## 3. Personal Data We Process

### 3.1 Information collected when you visit the website

We do not intentionally operate advertising trackers, third-party analytics tools or profiling systems on this website.

However, the hosting and delivery infrastructure provided by Vercel may automatically process technical information associated with website requests. Depending on the services and configuration in use, this may include:

* IP address;
* date and time of a request;
* requested page or resource;
* browser, device and operating-system information;
* technical diagnostics, error records and security-related logs;
* information derived from an IP address, such as an approximate location.

The exact information processed and its retention period depend on the services and configuration actually used by the hosting provider. We do not claim to have independently verified every technical log or infrastructure setting.

### 3.2 Information you send by email

If you contact us by email, we may process:

* your email address;
* your name or other details included in your message;
* the contents of your message and any attachments;
* information necessary to manage and respond to your request.

Emails are handled manually. We do not currently operate a website contact form, newsletter, user account system or online payment system.

Please avoid sending sensitive personal information unless it is genuinely necessary for your request.

