## 9. Your Data Protection Rights

Where the GDPR applies, you may have the right to:

* request access to your personal data;
* request correction of inaccurate data;
* request erasure of your data, where applicable;
* request restriction of processing;
* object to processing based on legitimate interests, on grounds relating to your particular situation;
* receive certain data in a portable format, where the legal conditions are met;
* withdraw consent where processing is based on consent;
* lodge a complaint with a competent data protection authority.

To exercise a right, email **[nextarrlabs@gmail.com](mailto:nextarrlabs@gmail.com)** and describe your request. We will handle requests manually and may ask for reasonable information to verify your identity where necessary.

In France, you may contact the Commission nationale de l’informatique et des libertés (CNIL):

https://www.cnil.fr/

These rights are subject to the conditions and exceptions provided by applicable law.

